  ## Delete Job Proposal — In Use (Conflict)

  Tests the safe-delete behavior when a job proposal has active order references.
  Expected: 409 Conflict with order reference count.
  Replace `PROPOSAL_WITH_ACTIVE_ORDERS_UUID` with a proposal ID that has active orders.
